Q: Is there an easy way to get which power of two a number is? A: <p>A neat way to achieve that is by using recursion.</p>
<pre><code>int which_power_of_two(int n)
{
    if (n == 1) {
        return 0;
    }
    return 1 + which_power_of_two(n / 2);
}
</code></pre>
